    "body": "guess so.\n\nI uploaded https://codereview.chromium.org/1786693002 to see which tests break. It appears to break five layout tests, but I'm not sure whether they actually test correct behavior.\n\ne.g.\nhttps://code.google.com/p/chromium/codesearch#chromium/src/third_party/WebKit/LayoutTests/http/tests/security/aboutBlank/security-context-alias.html sets document.domain and expects that it then still can acess its about:blank iframe.\n",
